{"id": "86328", "name": "אי-שוויון פולינומי – מכפלת חזקות זוגית ואי-זוגית ≤ 0 (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Solve the following inequality: \\[ {{CT:0}} \\le 0.\\] <br /> Write your answer as a logical sequence of inequalities, such as \"\\(x&gt;=13\\)\" or \"\\(x&gt;=-9\\ \\mbox{or}\\ x&gt;5\\)\". <br /> <br /> Solution : [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>The factor \\(({{CT:1}})^{{CT:2}}\\) is always positive because of the even power.</p>\n<p>The other factor \\(({{CT:3}})^{{CT:4}}\\) which has an odd power changes sign across \\({{CT:5}} = {{CT:6}}\\).</p>\n<p>So the inequality is satisfied for \\(({{CT:3}})\\le 0\\).</p>\n<p>This is entered as \\({{CT:5}} &lt;= {{CT:6}}\\)</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "EqualComAss", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": "<p>Wrong way round</p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "degr1", "degr2", "n1", "n2", "p", "v"], "nvariants": 50}